Diagram: source code (left) -> Semgrep CLI (center) applying a ruleset
(OWASP, secrets, language rules) -> findings report (right) grouped by severity
ERROR/WARNING/INFO. A gate box after the report shows PASS (green check, exit 0,
"merge allowed") or FAIL (red cross, exit non-zero, "merge blocked"). Flat style.
max-width 860px.
